      "hints": [
        "Complete the square: $-2(x^2 - 6x) - 3 = -2[(x - 3)^2 - 9] - 3$."
      ],
      "walkthrough": [
        "Factor out $-2$ from the quadratic terms and complete the square:\n$$-2x^2 + 12x - 3 = -2(x^2 - 6x) - 3 = -2\\left[(x - 3)^2 - 9\\right] - 3 = -2(x - 3)^2 + 18 - 3 = -2(x - 3)^2 + 15$$\nwhere $a = -3$ and $b = 15$."
      ],
      "checking": {
